H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-w1)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">GR与电阻率</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">0.5m深度对齐曲线</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">两侧滑窗特征</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">比较均值的持续改变</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">学习边界分数</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">6训练井逻辑回归</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">GR单点梯度</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">局部尖峰阈值对照</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">一对一边界核对</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">一对一匹配与重复误报</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">分层位置与误差</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">边界F1与深度MAE</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">间距约束合并</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">保留最小边界间距</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 构建两侧特征</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>6口训练井提取GR和logRt两侧均值差。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>两侧均值差特征的手算例（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>通道</th><th>上窗均值</th><th>下窗均值</th><th>差值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GR / API</td><td>35</td><td>105</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><td>log₁₀(Rt/1 Ω·m)</td><td>1.6</td><td>0.5</td><td>1.1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>GR差除以70固定尺度；Rt先取无量纲log。候选位置两侧都需要可见样本。</p><p><b>产物：</b>1020个候选训练位置</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：同井段不混入独立测试井。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 识别并合并边界</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>逻辑回归评分，再做最小间距抑制。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>相近候选只保留一个（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>候选MD / m</th><th>未校准支持分数</th><th>最小间距2m时</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1220</td><td>0.8</td><td>保留</td></tr><tr><td>1220.5</td><td>0.7</td><td>抑制</td></tr><tr><td>1228</td><td>0.6</td><td>保留</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>先按支持排序，再作距离抑制；调大间距会合并近邻候选，也可能漏掉相邻真实边界。</p><p><b>产物：</b>候选分数与最终边界</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：阈值变化后重新计算。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 一对一核对边界</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>以±1.5m容差匹配3个测试真边界。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>一对一容差匹配（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>预测MD / m</th><th>真边界MD / m</th><th>结论</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1220</td><td>1220.5</td><td>误差0.5m，命中</td></tr><tr><td>1221</td><td>1220.5</td><td>同一真边界已用，重复误报</td></tr><tr><td>无预测</td><td>1240</td><td>漏报</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>容差±1.5m；MAE只对匹配边界计算，空集显示不适用。</p><p><b>产物：</b>边界F1与匹配深度误差</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：未匹配边界保留为误报或漏报。</p></article>"
      }
